{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "25", "x": 0.9038164196379167, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.02992682896571904, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "D is activated when there is a need to communicate a sense of danger.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.7320857635592071, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Questions 31-35", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.17463708473164555, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Complete each sentence with the correct ending, A-G, below.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.6083203562373055, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "31 At times when they were relaxed, the firefighters usually", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.24630607605628574, "w": 0.6306948895309001, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.3, "bold": true}, {"t": "32 The researchers noted that when the firefighters were stressed, they", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2746735439806541, "w": 0.7528476305919288, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.3, "bold": true}, {"t": "33 When the firefighters were told good news, they always", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3030039694975767, "w": 0.6190037127361522, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.3, "bold": true}, {"t": "34 The students' cortisol levels and heart rates were affected when the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.33133430071101805, "w": 0.8259941614089307, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.3, "bold": true}, {"t": "researchers", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.3596646507851557, "w": 0.1266298391906352, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "35 In both experiments, negative information was processed better when the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.38799500085929334, "w": 0.8258851773830362, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.3, "bold": true}, {"t": "subjects", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.41632538865482344, "w": 0.09155625754391426, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "A", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.48280040298518045, "w": 0.026410812568698126, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "made them feel optimistic.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.48280040298518045, "w": 0.275440554852747, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "B", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5111307907807106, "w": 0.025604517885119353, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "took relatively little notice of bad news.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.5111307907807106, "w": 0.40609302468401043, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "C", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5394611408548482, "w": 0.026007671634718354, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "responded to negative and positive information in the same way.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.5394611408548482, "w": 0.656092999052772, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "D", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5677915286503784, "w": 0.026209235693898627, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "were feeling under stress.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.5677915286503784, "w": 0.269998120204972, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "E", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5961219164459085, "w": 0.024596659142360307, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "put them in a stressful situation.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.5961219164459085, "w": 0.33248554167470207, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "F", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6244523042414386, "w": 0.023991941333581034, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "behaved in a similar manner, regardless of the circumstances.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.6244523042414386, "w": 0.6321059020232582, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "G", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6527826543155762, "w": 0.0270155303774774, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "thought it more likely that they would experience something bad.", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.6527826543155762, "w": 0.6671794836699791, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Questions 36-40", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7421122682190177, "w": 0.17866854533392018, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Do the following statements agree with the information given in Reading Passage 3?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7704426937359403, "w": 0.8320992148331463, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "YES", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8271033938842155, "w": 0.06576173528815613, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "if the statement agrees with the claims of the writer", "x": 0.2886850744069726, "y": 0.8271033938842155, "w": 0.5333422171205805, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "NO", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8554584891918403, "w": 0.0389526260895455, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "if the statement contradicts the claims of the writer", "x": 0.2886850744069726, "y": 0.8554584891918403, "w": 0.5301170383862654, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "NOT GIVEN", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.883788914708763, "w": 0.13227387634444818, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "if it is impossible to say what the writer thinks about this", "x": 0.2886850744069726, "y": 0.883788914708763, "w": 0.5809132317987706, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}